# The top-level libzt/ is now a real submodule (nx-mod/libzt-nx), tracked
# intentionally. pc-diag/libzt/ stays untracked -- it's a deliberately stock,
# unpatched libzt clone used as a control build, re-cloned fresh each time.
/pc-diag/libzt/

dist/
libzt-switch.tar.gz

Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Local config with our own ZeroTier network ID -- not for the shared repo.
# The *.example file is a tracked template with a dummy ID; the real
# network_id.txt files (both here and under pc-diag/config/) stay local-only.
# The "**/" prefix is required on both lines -- a bare "config/*" (unlike a
# bare "config/") is anchored to the repo root by gitignore's own rules, and
# silently stopped matching pc-diag/config/ when this was first written.
**/config/*
!**/config/network_id.txt.example
